its Mark's 40 to 50, his repeated knee history and no back-to-backs. He starts healthy, with one expert expecting about 33 minutes.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gTsfR5PxAMY?t=490","https://youtu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=1131","https://youtu.be/8d--aL_xxwE?t=914"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"He does not play back-to-backs, and weeks 20 and 21 each have one. A seed-locked contender also has no reason to push him in March.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=833","https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=1148"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}